'''Fighting styles''' are an essential feature of ''Blox Fruits''. They are the core mechanism of the combat system in the game, and they can be obtained from the different teachers of a specific fighting style.

Compared to other weapon types, fighting styles involve mostly physical strikes, with less emphasis on weapons or super-powered abilities. Most have three combat moves, while [[Blox Fruits]] have 4-5 on average, and [[guns]]/[[swords]] have only two.

Fighting styles tend to focus more on versatility and utility when compared to other weapon types with their higher move counts and greater presence of abilities like stun, movement, or even life steal, although some are capable of outputting heavy raw damage.

Players who first join the game will receive [[Combat]] automatically.

